{
    "pageid": 3094,
    "title": "A.D. 633: Rise of Islam",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "A.D. 633: Rise of Islam is a mod for Crusader Kings II . It adds another start date to the game (633 AD), extending the timeline by more than 100 years, as well as many other features to go with the new start date."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Features",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "New start date of 633, just after the death of the Islamic prophet Muhammad.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Reformable Hellenic religion, complete with a playable religious head",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Cushitic paganism, the religion of many pre-Islamic East Africans",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New catholic heresy : Arianism",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Syriac and Coptic cultures as part of the Byzantine culture group",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Updated or new de jure titles, complete with new flags",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "No de jure kingdoms and empires in some tribal areas; instead, unlimited subjugation of same culture, and easier custom title creation",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Scripted events for the rise and fragmentation of early Islam",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Meticulously researched historical characters",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Status of the Mod",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The current release of the mod is characterized as a full release (v3.1.1 as of April 2019)."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Troubleshooting",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "If you experience a problem with the mod, make sure it has not already been reported. If not, report it on the ModDB page.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "If you are unable to launch the mod or get a black screen, check the settings.txt file in the mod folder first - it has to match the vanilla settings.txt (i.e. the one in your CKII folder).",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Q: What is this?"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "A: A.D. 633: Rise of Islam is a historical mod that adds a new start date and new features.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Q: What are some of the new features?"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "A: Several new religions and cultures, decisions, events, etc. Play the mod to discover the full list.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "\"Q: What DLC does the mod need/use?\""
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "A: The mod should run fine no matter which DLC is enabled/disabled.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Some of the DLC may add content to the mod, but it has apparently not been researched in depth."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Q: Fabricating claims isn't working/happening too often, what have you done to it?"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "A: The chances of fabricating a claim have not been altered from vanilla, so having loads of claims or none at all in a certain period of time can happen.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}